    <briefdescription>
<para>Concurrency and synchronization errors. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1ConcurrencyError" kindref="compound">ConcurrencyError</ref> represents errors related to locking, deadlocks, thread operations, cancellations, and race conditions.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Using<sp/>default<sp/>message</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">throw</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/><ref refid="classcslt_1_1ConcurrencyError_1a43e77edde01f50900d77cf9a7d64a607" kindref="member">ConcurrencyError</ref>();<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>&quot;Concurrency<sp/>error&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Using<sp/>custom<sp/>message</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">throw</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/><ref refid="classcslt_1_1ConcurrencyError_1a43e77edde01f50900d77cf9a7d64a607" kindref="member">ConcurrencyError</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Deadlock<sp/>detected<sp/>in<sp/>mutex<sp/>acquisition&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
